I go into the doctor's cabin and sit on the chair.
The doctor smiles and asks me.
"What is happening, Maya madam?"
"Are you not feeling well?"
I shake my head.
"No doctor, I am not feeling well at all."
"Since morning, I have had a severe cold."
"Do you have a fever?" the doctor asks.
"Yes, my body feels very warm," I say.
I point to my head.
"My head is hurting a lot."
"My nose is also completely blocked."
The doctor listens attentively.
Then I touch my throat.
"And my throat is also hurting."
"Are you coughing?"
"Yes, I have been getting a dry cough since last night."
"My whole body is aching too."
"This seems like the trouble of the beginning of the monsoon."
"You should go home now and take complete rest."
I agree and listen to the doctor's further instructions.
